items.back:
Relevant grant calls:
${rate_calls.relevant_list}
Starter packs (starter packs, strong only): ${starter_packs.packs}

Type in the comment box 'go: <call title>' or 'skip: <call title>' line by line, and if wishing to invite co-researchers 'invite: <name> <email> <call title>' then click Approve (Type go / skip per call, and optional invite lines, then Approve). Reject = skip all.
